1. Read `AGENTS.md`
2. Read `brain/TOOL_DETAIL_PAGE_STANDARDS.md`
3. Read `brain/CALCULATOR_STANDARDS.md`, `SEO_STANDARDS.md`, `EMBED_STANDARDS.md`, `AD_STANDARDS.md`

